Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,---------------------OPJP---------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:02:01.63,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}当たり前だった過去の形
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:06.70,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}君の隣で変わっていく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:11.95,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}心の距離は長く見えなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:17.07,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}不安だけれど読み進めよう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.41,0:02:22.60,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}いつも不思議な君の世界は
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:29.45,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}色鮮やかで　夢・希望　溢れて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:34.53,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}私のすべてを飲み込んだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:38.42,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}だんだん芽生えた最初の想い
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:45.53,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}わからないことは日々のページめくり物語を
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:51.30,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}どんどん広げよう　きっと君は探してた答え
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:59.21,OPJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,500)}優しい言葉で教えてくれるよ
Comment: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,---------------------OPCN---------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:02:01.63,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}以前那理所当然的姿态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:06.70,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}在你的身边渐渐被改变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:11.95,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}心灵的距离长得看不到头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:17.07,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}虽有不安  但还是能砥砺前行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.41,0:02:22.60,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}你那一如既往不可思议的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:29.45,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}不仅色彩斑斓  而且梦想和希望洋溢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:34.53,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}漫润了我的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:38.42,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}最初的梦想发荣滋长
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:45.53,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}每一天都是前所未知的新故事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:51.30,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}不断地充盈着生活  这必定就是你所寻求的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.44,0:02:59.21,OPCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,500)}亲切温柔地跟我们讲述这些未知吧
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,---------------------EDJP---------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:31.08,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}きらり輝く　宝石みたいに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:37.46,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}色とりどりの顔で笑うキミといた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:43.76,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}ちょっと不器用で　甲斐性も無いけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:49.37,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}ひた向きな背の　頑張る姿見てるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:56.07,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}だけど　並べる肩に　私の胸の内は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:23:03.78,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}うわの空揺らいで　冒険の途中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.83,0:23:09.68,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}キミは私の世界に羽を広げて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:13.57,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}さあ　高く遠くへ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:17.24,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}青い空エスコートして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.35,0:23:22.36,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}憧れを抱いた　捕らわれの姫
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.49,0:23:26.28,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}まだ　すぐじゃないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.41,0:23:31.66,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,500)}「この手を引いて」 ちゃんとね　言いたい
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,---------------------EDCN---------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:31.08,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}就像熠熠生辉的宝石一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:37.46,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}你那跟我在一起时笑靥如花的脸颊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:43.76,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}虽说你有些笨拙  也没什么志气
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:49.37,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}可你努力的身影却一直展现在我眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:56.07,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}不过  一旦与你肩并肩一起  我的内心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:23:03.78,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}在冒险的旅途中就会心神恍惚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.83,0:23:09.68,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}你已在我的世界里展开了羽翼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:13.57,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}来吧  向更高更远的地方飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:17.24,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}陪我一起翱翔蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.35,0:23:22.36,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}怀抱这美好的憧憬吧  被束缚的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.49,0:23:26.28,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,200)}虽然  我这不能立马为你实现
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.41,0:23:31.66,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\be5\fad(200,500)}但我还是想自信地对你说  「牵上我的手吧」
Comment: 0,0:23:41.66,0:23:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,---------------------TEXT---------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事啊  的场先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前我就有点不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.09,0:00:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这次买错得实在是太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:10.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买错？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要的是出租小圆的BD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买来的却是TMA的山寨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种错误简直匪夷所思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嘛  那就我…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还有利用价值  就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要的是机动天使班达的模型
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.11,0:00:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里面装的不是钢噶尔嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不像话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道你们是在哪里找到这种东西的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我最想说的是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都说了那么多次我要的是无印的难家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\fad(200,200)}（无印: 不带副标题的作品,一般就是系列作的第一期）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.95,0:00:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是「欢迎回来」吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经忍无可忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要自己去采购  让我回日本一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这稍稍有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.53,0:01:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洞口的事属于最高机密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.61,0:01:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去的时候再用药让我睡着了搬回去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是学生们非常期待的教材
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去可能会发生暴动的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为阿缪缇克的总管我要求立刻回国
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了  我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能问个问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「难家—欢迎回来」就这么糟糕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得它的制作会社和STAFF都很优秀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.73,0:01:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,监督他非常差劲！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(265,333)\fs13}及川 启
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  明天早上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自卫队的人来了  我被药弄睡着了以后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我和这些货物一起搬走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您会回来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我问了奇怪的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  我很快就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要让半精灵的女仆一起走？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  这点绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不让她的耳朵被发现就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这种问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实这边的住人对于PM2.5完全没有抵抗力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了我们那里以后呼吸系统就会出现问题  100%会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为一些原因我不能相送
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我先去把老爷的行李放到玄关那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那接下来我们带你去日本的家里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.85,0:04:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把药吞了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也要带走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不要了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的四肢已经到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:59.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说的话您是踢球踢得肌肉酸了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后又几天不作为所致的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎么了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意见的话就提升我的动力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.14,0:05:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说  我今天把这些文件都搞完的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就把慎一叫来之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.93,0:05:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗  你不骗我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  一口气搞完它  你等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  良太
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对  早安  老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举白旗了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.28,0:05:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是猫耳哟  哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么想都是梦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就随它去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:05:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的房间吗  一切都是那么的令人怀念…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  网络网络
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  还真有每月支付报酬
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.43,0:06:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.69,0:06:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪  为什么会有2个包裹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缪雪儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}（异界语）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊  在这里指环不起作用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对  为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:06:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.35,0:07:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我怕老爷再也不回来了  就…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缪雪儿  身体没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有胸闷气喘之类的问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被骗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.85,0:07:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个半精灵的女仆？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.27,0:07:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是混进了慎一的行李里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:38.02,SPEC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(290,70)\an8\fs16\be0}这个也青一起搬走  慎一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把「讠」漏了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要立刻把她带回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我姑且还是有监视着他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了啦  把头抬起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少作为赔礼让我帮您整理一下房间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.67,0:07:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗手间在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,节奏很不错  等着我慎一
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  慎一他回去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没告诉你们真是很对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是明天他就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我觉得那些文件的量可能没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完事了以后拉一下后面的拉杆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股被水喷了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:09:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的不是精灵取来在里面让水流出来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  不是的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.65,0:09:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害  日本好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我去检查一下教材
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缪雪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机会难得  一起去一次秋叶原吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秋叶原？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,文化的发源地
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:28.84,EYECHATCH,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(97,203)\be1}自卫队员
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:28.84,EYECHATCH,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(55,325)\be1}喜欢的游戏：舰kone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:28.84,EYECHATCH,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(55,345)\be1}喜欢的角色：驱逐舰  岛风
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:32.84,EYECHATCH,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(92,203)\be1}艾尔丹特士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:32.84,EYECHATCH,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(55,325)\be1}喜欢的动画：万达AGE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:32.84,EYECHATCH,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(55,345)\be1}喜欢的角色：伊瓦库尔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汽车好多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是巴士了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只在漫画里看见过  好感动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本真是好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是飞奔小孩是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有让人心动的千元自动贩卖机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:10:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  老爷  好像有什么小纸条出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.57,0:10:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是车票
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿了它才能乘电车
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电车？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:07.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放进那里面然后过去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.93,0:10:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  开了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把票拿好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大  电车好大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.26,0:10:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门自动就开了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去的时候票是不会出来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天真的好高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  还什么都没做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an8}战队咖啡  秘密基地  请多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.09,0:11:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是秋叶原了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有和我一样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里也是  这里也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是女仆咖啡店里为了拉客而变装的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变装？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是所谓的cosplay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要来试试？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战队咖啡  秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边虽然也不错  但是先从我推荐的开始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这栋建筑物里全都是漫画动画还有游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得世界上也没有如此大量制作动画的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:49.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,种类也很丰富
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.75,0:11:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派发预约好的CD和BD的递交会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:12:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以和相关作品的主役声优们见面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我想预约的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带运动短裤生写的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羡慕
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  如果可以的话  下次我也穿运动短裤让您拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道她明不明白自己在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是不知为何就成为了世界知名的荞麦面馆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个要蘸上酱汁吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缪雪儿  你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔  恶魔的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真开心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:29.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么地方想去的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.35,0:13:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉有点紧张啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的  缪雪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临  主人  大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是大小姐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天一天也辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.81,0:13:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没没没  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,点亮这盏蜡烛灯  这里就会变成魔法世界  嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来日本也有魔法师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我叫惠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.43,0:14:14.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您想吃什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边推荐的果然还是萌萌蛋包饭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让女仆画师由美在上面画上你喜欢的画像
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.22,0:14:29.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是女仆画师由美  请问要画什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然还是小圆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小圆是吗  那么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  厉害  好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见笑见笑  大小姐想要画什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吗  我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就画老爷的脸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:14:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.26,0:15:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么   一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得美味  变得美味  萌萌啾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缪雪儿  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要  要我把老爷给吃了什么的  根本做不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.49,0:15:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙是专业的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样  我花了30分钟才让缪雪儿开始吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天好开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.23,0:15:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的事情我一生都不会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有  太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.19,0:15:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔细想想  现在是和女孩子两人独处  而且还是晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:16:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边的世界没怎么注意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是在自己的房间里不知怎么地就意识起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩  玩游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起那个  我得先给老爷上茶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爷你出了很多汗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没  这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  我去准备洗澡水
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.53,0:16:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缪雪儿来服侍你洗澡了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个怎么说都不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  洗澡什么的我自己来就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我来铺床
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铺床
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.61,0:16:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铺床
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.39,0:16:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.04,0:16:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缪雪儿来铺床了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.93,0:17:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来  缪雪儿你的替换衣服呢  内衣什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没带
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢  在自己的房间里把持不住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,温水已准备完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（听到「温水已准备完毕」的话就能去洗澡了）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上去买  你先去洗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是浴巾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汗衫的话你就挑喜欢的穿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  老爷  我先去洗了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迦流士  差不多可以去叫慎一来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.60,0:17:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不妙啊  没想到陛下这么有干劲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:57.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必慌张
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这个身经百战的札哈尔还有秘策
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无  无法下手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在不是害羞的时候啊  随它去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总共525円
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收您1万円
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  快点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.81,0:18:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  对不起  零钱没有了  请稍等片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.81,0:18:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是  神的指示吗  是神的意愿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不  冷静一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电影也很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饭也很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:58.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于冷静下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚要好好做一些爱做的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易才平静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要迷惘  加纳慎一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.87,0:19:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标就在前方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是机会  绝对不会放走你的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.73,0:19:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哟  5年没见了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指环没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉  还是在的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:53.26,SPEC2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(364,273)\be1}想\N干\N就\N干\N{\i1}！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她应该不是知道意思才选这件的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔细想想  这下面什么都没有穿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是让人无比躁动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.71,0:20:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.48,0:20:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋包饭真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.93,0:20:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  完成了  已经去传唤慎一了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  扎哈尔宰相已经去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了  佩特菈卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  慎一  呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的努力工作了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:21:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说  慎一他一个人回日本了是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说白了就是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们结婚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.50,0:21:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经回来了  就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:36.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天真是开心啊  嗯  真开心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  我是为了什么回去的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃  也就是说想要的东西一个都没有带过来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.27,0:21:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还让我们出动了自卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.19,0:21:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花费了不少国家经费呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:22:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  什么都没做  收获为0  是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.79,0:22:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.99,0:22:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到收获的话还是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爷真不争气  明明我特地选了那件T恤等您
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.91,0:23:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缪雪儿  这究竟是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是按着写的台词念而已
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.57,0:23:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶  这帮制作人员  想要捉弄我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.63,0:23:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然分镜被切了  但在剧本里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.51,0:23:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在老爷睡着后  一个人做一些不该做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  缪雪儿  你做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.64,0:24:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分镜被切了所以我也不知道  请您去问导演吧
